# Mission 5: The Eyes of Argus (Implementation Plan)

## Goal
Create a real-time visualization of the Nucleus "Brain" (Memory) in the HUD. This allows the operator to instantly see the size, structure, and health of the system's context without digging into file explorers.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> I will implement a **2D Memory Matrix** (Grid View) initially. 
> Each cell represents a file in the `.brain` directory.
> Color coding:
> - **Red**: Strategy/Context ([.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md))
> - **Blue**: Agents/Personas (`agents/`)
> - **Green**: Logs/Data (`.jsonl`, `.json`)
> - **Purple**: Memory/Knowledge (`memory/`)

## Proposed Changes

### Backend (Python)

#### [MODIFY] [server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py)
- **New Endpoint**: `GET /api/memory`
- **Logic**: 
    - Scans the `.brain` directory recursively.
    - Returns a flat list of "nodes": `{ id, type, path, size, last_modified }`.
    - `type` is derived from file extension or parent folder.

### Frontend (Nucleus HUD)

#### [NEW] [MemoryMatrix.tsx](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/app/components/MemoryMatrix.tsx)
- Fetches data from`/api/memory`.
- Renders a responsive grid of colored blocks.
- **Interactivity**: Hovering over a block shows the filename and size.
- **Animation**: Blocks "pulse" when files are modified (detected via `last_modified` diffs).

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/app/page.tsx)
- Import `MemoryMatrix`.
- Add it to a new section or replace an existing placeholder (likely under "Active Swarms" or a new "Cortex State" column).
- *Decision*: I will add it to the Right Column, moving `ResearchWidget` down or combining them. 

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- **Unit Test**: Create `tests/test_memory_api.py` to verify `/api/memory` returns valid JSON structure.
- **Browser Test**:
    1. Load HUD.
    2. Check if the Matrix is visible.
    3. Verify tooltips appear on hover.
